.broker-sasl-password
# Throwaway CA + broker keypair generated by broker-up.sh S3. The CA private key
# is a real private key for as long as the broker is up, and the whole tree is
# regenerated on demand -- there is nothing here worth committing and one thing
# here that must never be.
.tls/
# Client secret for the throwaway OIDC provider used by stage S4. Generated on
# demand by broker-up.sh; a real credential for as long as that provider is up.
.oidc-client-secret
